THE PIANO
Salamander Grand Piano V3 (2016-12-09), a Yamaha C5,
by Alexander Holm.
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
Source: https://freepats.zenvoid.org/Piano/
SalamanderGrandPiano/
SalamanderGrandPianoV3+20161209_44khz16bit.tar.xz
Changed for this disk: one velocity layer and one sample
every three semitones, converted to 8 bits, resampled to
Paula's rates, cut to a recorded attack plus a short
crossfaded loop, and set to new levels, with each sample's
original level kept for the player.

THE PERFORMANCES
