Changed for this disk: each performance's notes, velocities
and sustain pedal converted to this player's score format.
The titles on the screen were written for this disk.

THE PICTURE
Generated with OpenAI's image model from the project's own
description (piano-title.json), then cropped, reduced to
13 colours and dithered for this screen.

